<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hah...!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン後部座席昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "15" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">So this is... inside the car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is driving the car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looking around, we're still on the Arata mountain road, it seems.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's the date today? Year, month, day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Um... it's May 5, Shiyo 800..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What about <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's... um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I stabbed <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> to death. That's right, isn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's... right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">For now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is at the Niimura main house, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Soon the police will come for the autopsy―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seems I managed to come back to the time I intended.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Right now: Shiyo 800, May 5, early morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">: a few hours since I stabbed her to death, I'd say.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, stop the car."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Just stop it. I'm not going to run."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, what are you going to do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! You're listening, aren't you!? Come out!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, what are you...!"</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Come on, you want </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> to live forever, don't you!? I'll help, so come out!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Shigatsu... Youka...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh? </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="8">, you seem to know all sorts of things, somehow."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Brutal.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"E-</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"You're kidding...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="8">, I'll hear the details later. What is it you'll help with?"</STYLE><PG>
"Before that, tell me. 
{PAUSE ""}
With this many witnesses to <STYLE ID="8">you, Dad</STYLE>, you can't let them go home alive, can you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hahaha! Well, that's true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">You've found out about me, and even about </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, so I can't very well let you go home like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then let's make a deal."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh? What, exactly?"</STYLE><PG>
"Bring <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> back to life. 
{PAUSE ""}
In exchange, I'll give you a living first generation and second generation."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hmm, so that's it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Fine by me. Now, things being what they are, we'd better hurry."</STYLE><PG>
"Good. <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>, do you have Droga?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Sure. </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="8">, you'll do it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. I'll at least do the stabbing myself."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Here. There's only one, okay?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">... what are you going to do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> matters, but I don't want to be parted from either of you. 
{PAUSE ""}
So... 
{PAUSE ""}
Let's become one. 
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
Forever."<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\赤背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ow!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, what is that...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE>, help me. I can't beat <STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE> strength right now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Sure thing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ナイフ投げる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\血のイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What is this...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　This is... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> blood...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Ugh...! S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">...! I...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"What'll it be, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
　You might not feel the pain right now because of the Droga, but if this goes on, <STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE>'ll bleed to death. 
{PAUSE ""}
But if you wish to become one with me, you won't have to die."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"N-no... I don't... want to die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"Come on, then wish it. That you don't want to die, so please help you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"H-help me..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Good, that secures a living first generation. 
{PAUSE ""}
Next..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Stop...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Wake up...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, you don't have to be scared. If <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> wish it, you'll be with us forever."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I've come back to life. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Now, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> wish to be with us, it'll be just as you wish."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"S-stop it...!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, if this goes on, <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE>'ll be all alone. 
{PAUSE ""}
You'll lose me and <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> both. Is that really okay with you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, do you want to lose any more of your family?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No! </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">! Don't go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Then you should wish it. To be with us forever..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
"After trying to kill a child in Megasawa to protect me, you're not going to hesitate now, are you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Come now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. Let's be together forever. We're family, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Family... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Together... forever..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Come, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="1">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and you went together, didn't you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, where's <STYLE ID="12">Chiga-nee</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She was here until just now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, right. Of course. There's about to be a bloodbath. She's hiding, I bet."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみメッタざし.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'm taking <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> with me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="10">! What are you going to do!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm having <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> brought back to life."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"H-hey...!"</STYLE><PG>
"Well, it should be about time. 
{PAUSE ""}
From what <STYLE ID="13">Dad</STYLE> says, Motoki-cho should be ready by now too."<PG>
